    "sr_preview_exit_tooltip": "Exit preview",
    "tooltip_scroll_stages": "Value at each point as the element crosses the screen: **Start** — about to appear from the bottom; **Middle** — roughly centred; **End** — just past the top. Set Middle and End to the same value to let the effect finish at centre and hold.",
    "tooltip_scroll_trigger": "Narrows the range the effect runs in, as a % of that trip. **20% → 80%** keeps it to the middle stretch and holds the Start/End value outside it. Leave both empty to use the full range.",
    "tooltip_scroll_horizontal": "<b>Moves the element horizontally as visitors scroll.</b><br> For a noticeable effect, use a movement of at least 100px.<br>This animation overrides any Transform settings in the Design tab.",
    "tooltip_scroll_rotate": "Tilts the element as you scroll. Applied to the box's first child, so the content inside rotates.",
    "tooltip_scroll_opacity": "Fades the element as you scroll — **0** is invisible, **1** fully visible. An Entrance animation on the same element overrides this.",
    "tooltip_scroll_scale": "Grows or shrinks the element as you scroll. Uses the standalone **scale** property, so it stacks with Transform instead of replacing it, and keeps working alongside an Entrance animation.",
    "tooltip_scroll_blur": "Blurs the element as you scroll. Blur is repainted every scroll frame — keep the radius modest on large sections to avoid stutter on mobile.",
    "tooltip_scroll_duration": "Smoothing only: how long values take to catch up with the scroll position (**transition-duration**). It does not set how long the effect lasts — the scroll distance does.",
    "tooltip_scroll_timing": "Easing for that smoothing. **linear** tracks the scroll most closely; **ease** softens the start and end.",
    "tooltip_entrance_type": "Plays once when the element scrolls into view, then holds its last frame. On the same property (opacity, transform) it overrides the **Scrolling** tab.",
    "tooltip_entrance_duration": "How long the entrance effect runs.",
    "tooltip_entrance_delay": "Counted from the moment the element enters the viewport, not from page load.",
    "tooltip_entrance_loop": "Repeats forever instead of playing once. While it runs it keeps overriding the Scrolling tab — use sparingly.",
    "tooltip_hover_type": "Plays while the cursor is over the element. If the element already has an Entrance animation, both write **animation-name** on the same node and can look wrong together.",
    "tooltip_hover_duration": "How long the hover effect runs.",
    "tooltip_hover_loop": "Repeats for as long as the cursor stays on the element.",
    "tooltip_click_type": "Runs only while the mouse button is held down (**:active**), usually 80–150ms, so longer effects get cut off part-way. Prefer something short.",
    "tooltip_click_duration": "Keep this short — the effect stops the moment the button is released.",
    "warning_entrance_overrides_scrolling": "This element also uses an <b>Entrance</b> animation. Once the Entrance animation finishes, its final state overrides the Scrolling effect for <b>Horizontal Position</b> and <b>Opacity</b>. <b>Scale</b> and <b>Blur</b> will still work with scrolling."
